{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerfully convenient snapshot testing."}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"title":"Essentials","anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/InlineSnapshotTesting\/documentation\/InlineSnapshotTesting\/assertInlineSnapshot(of:as:message:options:matches:fileID:file:function:line:column:)","doc:\/\/InlineSnapshotTesting\/documentation\/InlineSnapshotTesting\/InlineSnapshotAssertionOptions"]},{"anchor":"Writing-a-custom-helper","identifiers":["doc:\/\/InlineSnapshotTesting\/documentation\/InlineSnapshotTesting\/InlineSnapshotSyntaxDescriptor"],"title":"Writing a custom helper"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Functions","identifiers":["doc:\/\/InlineSnapshotTesting\/documentation\/InlineSnapshotTesting\/assertInlineSnapshot(of:as:message:record:timeout:syntaxDescriptor:matches:fileID:file:function:line:column:)"],"title":"Functions"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"InlineSnapshotTesting"}],"externalID":"InlineSnapshotTesting","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","symbolKind":"module","title":"InlineSnapshotTesting"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/InlineSnapshotTesting\/documentation\/InlineSnapshotTesting","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/choule99\/swift-snapshot-testing","isActive":true},{"text":" writes the snapshots it generates directly to disk","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"alongside the test files. This makes for compact test cases with single line assertions…"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["assertSnapshot(of: value, as: .json)"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"…but can make verification more cumbersome: one must find the corresponding file in order to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verify that it matches their expectation. In this case, if the above assertion is the second one in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"testMySnapshot()"},{"type":"text","text":" method in a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MySnapshotTests.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" file, the snapshot will be found at:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"sh","code":["$ cat __Snapshots__\/MySnapshotTests\/testMySnapshot.2.json","{","  \"id\": 42,","  \"name\": \"Blob\"","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Inline Snapshot Testing offers an alternative approach by writing string snapshots directly into"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the test file. This makes it easy to verify a snapshot test at any time, since the value and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"snapshot sit next to each other in the assertion. One can ","type":"text"},{"code":"import InlineSnapshotTesting","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and rewrite"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"the above assertion as:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["assertInlineSnapshot(of: value, as: .json)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"And when the test is run, it will automatically insert the snapshot as a trailing closure to be used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"by future test runs, and fail:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["assertInlineSnapshot(of: value, as: .json) {  \/\/ ❌","  \"\"\"","  {","    \"id\": 42,","    \"name\": \"Blob\"","  }","  \"\"\"","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"syntax":null,"code":["❌ failed - Automatically recorded a new snapshot.","","Re-run \"testMySnapshot\" to test against the newly-recorded snapshot."],"type":"codeListing"},{"name":"Warning","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When a snapshot is written into a test file, the undo history of the test file in Xcode"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"will be lost. Be careful to avoid losing work, and commit often to version control."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We would love for this to be fixed. Please "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/www.apple.com\/feedback\/","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with Apple to improve"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"things, or if you have an idea of how we can improve things from the library, please","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/choule99\/swift-snapshot-testing\/discussions","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/choule99\/swift-snapshot-testing\/pulls"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"warning"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/inlinesnapshottesting"]}],"references":{"https://www.apple.com/feedback/":{"type":"link","url":"https:\/\/www.apple.com\/feedback\/","identifier":"https:\/\/www.apple.com\/feedback\/","title":"file feedback","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"file feedback"}]},"https://github.com/choule99/swift-snapshot-testing":{"title":"Snapshot Testing","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/choule99\/swift-snapshot-testing","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/choule99\/swift-snapshot-testing","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Snapshot Testing"}]},"doc://InlineSnapshotTesting/documentation/InlineSnapshotTesting/InlineSnapshotAssertionOptions":{"title":"InlineSnapshotAssertionOptions","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"InlineSnapshotAssertionOptions"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/inlinesnapshottesting\/inlinesnapshotassertionoptions","abstract":[{"text":"Options t